<body class="wp-singular page-template page-template-elementor_canvas page page-id-18 wp-embed-responsive wp-theme-twentytwentyfive elementor-default elementor-template-canvas elementor-kit-4 elementor-page elementor-page-18">
			<div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="18" class="elementor elementor-18">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00000 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html" data-id="e00000" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="html.default">
					<style id="exjsx-raw-ykrhga-0">.elementor-element-e00000{margin:0 !important;height:0;line-height:0;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e00003-s.e-ykrhga-e00003-s{text-transform: uppercase;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0000r-s.e-ykrhga-e0000r-s{min-width: 0px;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0000s-s.e-ykrhga-e0000s-s{text-transform: uppercase;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0000v-s.e-ykrhga-e0000v-s{& { border-left: 4px solid #FFFDF7; }}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0000w-s.e-ykrhga-e0000w-s{min-width: 0px;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e00012-s.e-ykrhga-e00012-s{min-width: 0px;}</style>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00001 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00001-s " data-id="e00001" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00001">
    <section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00002 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00002-s " data-id="e00002" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00002">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00003-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00003">Little Molar · dentistry for children only</p>
					<h1 data-interaction-id="e00004" class="e-ykrhga-e00004-s e-heading-base">The first visit is a visit. Nothing else happens.</h1>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00005-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00005">Little Molar is a dental practice only for children. The first appointment involves sitting in the chair, counting teeth, choosing a sticker, and going home. No drill, no needle, no surprises, ever.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00006 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00006-s " data-id="e00006" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00006">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00007-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00007"><a href="#book" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Book a first visit
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00008-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00008">Or call us — we will talk it through first.</p>
		
</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00009 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00009-s " data-id="e00009" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00009">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000a-s " data-id="e0000a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000a">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0000b" class="e-ykrhga-e0000b-s e-heading-base">What we promise before you ever walk in</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000c">Three rules we do not bend, because a frightened child remembers the first appointment for the next twenty years.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000d e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0000d-s " data-id="e0000d" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0000d">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000e-s " data-id="e0000e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000e">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000f">01</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000g" class="e-ykrhga-e0000g-s e-heading-base">No treatment on the first visit</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000h">No treatment on the first visit, even if we spot something. We book that separately, so your child never learns that coming here means something scary happens.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000i-s " data-id="e0000i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000i">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000j">02</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000k" class="e-ykrhga-e0000k-s e-heading-base">Your child picks the room</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000l">Three treatment rooms with different themes and your child picks. It sounds small. It is the difference between a child who walks in and one who is carried in.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000m-s " data-id="e0000m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000m">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000n">03</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000o" class="e-ykrhga-e0000o-s e-heading-base">Tell, show, do</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000p">Tell, show, do. Every instrument is explained, then demonstrated on a finger or a toy, then used. Nothing touches a child that they have not already met.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000q-s " data-id="e0000q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000q">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000r-s " data-id="e0000r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000r">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000s">If your child says no</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0000t" class="e-ykrhga-e0000t-s e-heading-base">If your child says no, we stop.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000u">We might get three teeth counted the first time and all twenty the third time, and that is a completely normal and successful course of treatment.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000v">Nobody is held down. Nobody is talked over. Coming back a second time is progress, not a failed appointment.</p>
		
</div>
			<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0000w-s" data-interaction-id="e0000w" id="142" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-little-molar-child_chair-1.jpg" width="1024" height="768" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-little-molar-child_chair-1.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-little-molar-child_chair-1-300x225.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-little-molar-child_chair-1-768x576.jpg 768w" alt="A young child sitting calmly in a dental chair at Little Molar"/>		
</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000x-s " data-id="e0000x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000y-s " data-id="e0000y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000z-s " data-id="e0000z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000z">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e00010" class="e-ykrhga-e00010-s e-heading-base">Trained for children, not adapted to them</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00011-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00011">Two dentists with pediatric postgraduate qualifications, two therapists, and a nurse who has been calming small children here since 2009.</p>
		
</div>
			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e00012-s" data-interaction-id="e00012" id="143" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-little-molar-waiting_room-1.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-little-molar-waiting_room-1.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-little-molar-waiting_room-1-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-little-molar-waiting_room-1-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="The bright, toy-filled waiting room at Little Molar"/>		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00013 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00013-s " data-id="e00013" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00013">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00014 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00014-s " data-id="e00014" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00014">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00015-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00015">2</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00016-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00016">Dentists with pediatric postgrad training</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00017 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00017-s " data-id="e00017" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00017">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00018-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00018">2</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00019-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00019">Therapists for prevention and sealants</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001a-s " data-id="e0001a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001a">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001b">2009</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001c">The year our nurse started here</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001d-s " data-id="e0001d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001d">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001e-s " data-id="e0001e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001e">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0001f" class="e-ykrhga-e0001f-s e-heading-base">What it costs, before you ask</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001g">Check-up £46. We hold 40 NHS places for under-18s and the waiting list is currently about seven weeks.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001h e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0001h-s " data-id="e0001h" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0001h">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001i-s " data-id="e0001i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001i">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001j">£46</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001k">A check-up, privately. Nothing is added without you agreeing to it first.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001l-s " data-id="e0001l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001l">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001m">40</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001n">NHS places held for under-18s. The waiting list is currently about seven weeks.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001o-s " data-id="e0001o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001o">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001p">8:30 &amp; 11:00</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001q">Emergency slots kept free every single morning for children in pain.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001r-s " data-id="e0001r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001r">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001s">“</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001t-s " data-id="e0001t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001t">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0001u" class="e-ykrhga-e0001u-s e-heading-base">My son screamed in the car park at our old dentist. At Little Molar he asked whether he could come back next week. I nearly cried in reception.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001v">Parent of a six-year-old · Little Molar patient since 2024</p>
		
</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001w-s " data-id="e0001w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001w">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001x-s " data-id="e0001x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001x">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0001y" class="e-ykrhga-e0001y-s e-heading-base">A child in pain today is seen today</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001z">Emergency slots are kept free every morning. Call before 8:30 and you will almost always be in the same day — even if you have never been here before.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00020 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00020-s " data-id="e00020" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00020">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00021-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00021">8:30</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00022-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00022">11:00</p>
		
</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00023 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00023-s " data-id="e00023" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00023" id="book">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00024 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00024-s " data-id="e00024" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00024">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00025 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00025-s " data-id="e00025" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00025">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e00026" class="e-ykrhga-e00026-s e-heading-base">Book a first visit</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00027-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00027">Tell us your child’s name and age and anything that frightens them. The first appointment is a visit — sit in the chair, count teeth, choose a sticker, go home.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00028 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00028-s " data-id="e00028" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00028">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00029-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00029"><a href="#book" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Book a first visit
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002a">NHS and private · Check-up £46 · Under-18s only</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>

</div>
